## How to Run

```
node serve.ts
```
Open **http://localhost:8080** in Chrome or any modern browser that supports WebGL.

## Controls

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| W/A/S/D | Move / Drive |
| Shift | Sprint / Handbrake |
| F | Enter/exit vehicle |
| R | Reload |
| 1-5 | Switch weapons |
| Left-click | Fire weapon |

## Features

- **3D open world** — a procedurally generated coastal city with roads, buildings, beach, water, marina, and palm trees
- **6-mission storyline** — steal cars, deliver cargo, survive gang ambushes, lose a 5-star manhunt, and win a checkpoint race
- **Vehicle system** — drive sedans, taxis, trucks, sports cars, police cruisers, and the legendary Comet
- **Wanted system** — 0–5 stars with police cruisers, roadblocks, helicopters with spotlights, and on-foot officers
- **Combat** — 5 weapons (fists, pistol, SMG, shotgun, rifle) with firing, reload, and melee
- **Traffic & pedestrians** — AI-driven cars navigate the road grid; pedestrians walk sidewalks and flee from danger
- **3-station radio** — Coast FM, Neon Nights, and Dusk Drive (procedural synth)
- **HUD** — minimap with road grid, player marker, police dots, and mission beacon; health, armour, cash, rank, and wanted stars
- **Save & continue** — progress is saved to localStorage
- **Neon signs** — distinct district colours with animated neon storefronts along Casino Row
- **Dusk & night lighting** — directional, hemisphere, and ambient lights with fog

